    <Name>INT_2020_0225</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0225","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>Towards negative space and its landlord</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0225","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2020-10-02</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2020_0225","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Quilla Pereira talks about a sculpture made entirely of hesitation. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
